<<~ ahu slot=`#/verdict-land-at-ecb26d4d0`>>

!! Verdict: LAND at `ecb26d4d0`

Both blockers are cured, and I measured both. The absence source cannot take in a node, and a leaf's absence opens no secrets doc through any gate standing today. Three residues remain (R1–R3). They are P2/P3, and each fails closed or rests behind a gate, so they ride as owed rows.

Dist was fresh (built 17:49, after the source edit at 17:48). In bwrap, under a scratch HOME/LAR_ROOT with LAR_BAGS unset:
* `p27-plugin-proof`, `p27-leaf-absence`, `p27-honest-floor` and `node-plugin-resolution` pass 19/19.
* Mesh `p27-cas-floor`, `promote-resolve` and `browser-holds-no-secrets-door` pass 8/8.

<<~/ahu>>

